    },
    {
      "text": "Master placement preparation through structured learning modules tailored for top companies like Google, Amazon, and Microsoft.",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "\"The only way to do great work is to love what you do. Don't settle. Keep looking.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Co-founder, Apple Inc.",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Persistence is very important. You should not give up unless you are forced to give up.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "CEO, Tesla & SpaceX",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Your most unhappy customers are your greatest source of learning. Success is a lousy teacher.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Co-founder, Microsoft",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"The most important investment you can make is in yourself. Knowledge builds up like interest.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "CEO, Berkshire Hathaway",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Wear your failure as a badge of honor. It's the only way to truly innovate and grow.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "CEO, Google & Alphabet",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"You've got to be a lifelong learner. Curiosity is your greatest asset in this era.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "CEO, Microsoft",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"The biggest risk is not taking any risk. Move fast and break things to find what works.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Founder & CEO, Meta",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I knew that if I failed I wouldn't regret that, but I knew I might regret not trying.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Founder, Amazon",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Software is eating the world, but AI is going to eat software. Never stop being a student.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Founder & CEO, NVIDIA",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"The sidelines are not where you want to live your life. The world needs you in the arena.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "CEO, Apple Inc.",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"An important attribute of success is to be yourself. Never hide what makes you unique.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Former CEO, PepsiCo",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "\"No matter how brilliant your mind, if you’re playing a solo game, you’ll lose to a team.\"",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Co-founder, LinkedIn",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "From outdated methods to intelligent, outcome-driven learning.",
      "tag": "p",
      "size": 20
    },
